  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">St&#xf6;d till tidskriften &quot;Feminist Africa&quot; under tre &#xe5;r, f&#xf6;r att m&#xf6;jligg&#xf6;ra tryckning och spridning av tidskriften till en st&#xf6;rre l&#xe4;sekrets &#xe4;n den man n&#xe5;r via internet. Tidskriften ges ut av African Gender Institute vid University of Cape Town, Sydafrika.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support for the journal &quot;Feminist Africa&quot; during three years, in order to enable print and distribution of the journal to a wider group of readers than those reached over the internet. The journal is published by the African Gender Institute at the University of Cape Town, South Africa.</narrative>
  </description>
